<title>USA: McNairy Cty, Tenn, won by First Tennessee.</title>
<headline>McNairy Cty, Tenn, won by First Tennessee.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Tennessee said it won $6.750 million of McNairy Cty, Tenn., school bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.0577 percent.</p>
</text>
